     <td><para unique="1261859">B</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261861">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261863">(AVX512VL AND</para>
      <para unique="1261867">AVX512F) OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+154546"/> </para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261869">Convert four packed double precision floating-point values in ymm2/m256/m64bcst to four signed doubleword integers in xmm1 subject to writemask k1.</para>
