     <td><para unique="1261836">AVX512F </para>
      <para unique="1261837">OR AVX10.1 <anchor id="+113866"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261839">Convert eight packed double precision floating-point values in zmm2/m512/m64bcst to eight signed doubleword integers in ymm1 subject to writemask k1.</para>
